    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3048" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpŏcynon</span></b> ,
		i, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόκυνον</span> (dog'sbane). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A little bone in the left side of the venomous
			frog</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 32, 5, 8, §
			51</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A plant</i>, <i>dog's-bane</i>:
			Aconitum lycoctonum, Linn.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 24, 11, 56, §
		98</span></i>.</div>
